{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01952","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 采桑秦氏女 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 采桑秦氏女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南陌采桑出，谁知妾姓秦。\n独怜倾国貌，不负早莺春。\n珠履荡花湿，龙钩折桂新。\n使君那驻马，自有侍中人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}